      <headword id="idp115833920">cliath</headword>
      <description>harrow. Consisted of four wooden main beams with six cross beams. Probably eight tines (iron) in each row, about 32 tines each placed so that they ran in different runs. Pulled by one horse with one amal beag.</description>
    </item>
